sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as FastAPI lifecycle
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant Reconciler
    participant REST as Bybit REST
    participant WS as Private WebSocket

    App->>DB: Initialize schema
    App->>Reconciler: Full startup reconciliation
    Reconciler->>REST: Read open positions
    REST-->>Reconciler: Current position snapshot
    Reconciler->>DB: Replace local position snapshot / update signal states

    App->>DB: Load bounded unresolved submissions
    loop Each unresolved submission
        App->>REST: Find order by orderLinkId
        REST->>REST: Search open orders, then history
        REST-->>App: Order or not found yet
        App->>REST: Read current positions
        REST-->>App: Position snapshot
        App->>DB: Persist reconciliation result
    end

    App->>WS: Subscribe position/order/execution/wallet

    Note over WS,DB: Incoming events are fingerprinted, persisted and processed by event handlers.
    WS->>DB: Record event fingerprint
    WS->>DB: Apply order/execution event by stable identifiers

    WS->>Reconciler: Position notification triggers REST refresh
    Reconciler->>REST: Read full open-position snapshot
    REST-->>Reconciler: Current positions
    Reconciler->>DB: Synchronize snapshot and lifecycle transitions
    opt Live execution enabled and protection adjustment required
        Reconciler->>REST: Update position TP/SL
        REST-->>Reconciler: Protection update result
    end

    loop Configured periodic interval
        Reconciler->>REST: Read open positions
        REST-->>Reconciler: Current positions
        Reconciler->>DB: Synchronize local state
        opt Live execution enabled and protection adjustment required
            Reconciler->>REST: Update position TP/SL
            REST-->>Reconciler: Protection update result
        end
    end
